<article class="card">
    <h2>Your first flight</h2>
    <ol>
        <li>In <strong>Dispatch</strong>, import your SimBrief plan or enter the flight yourself, then select <strong>Accept flight</strong>.</li>
        <li>Load the aircraft at the gate in MSFS 2024 and select <strong>Launch / connect to MSFS 2024</strong>.</li>
        <li>Fly as you normally would. Off block, takeoff and landing are recorded as they happen.</li>
        <li>At the gate, set the parking brake. On the Fenix A320 family, shutting down the engines confirms block in. On other aircraft, select <strong>Confirm parked</strong> when it appears.</li>
        <li>Review the flight and submit your PIREP.</li>
    </ol>
</article>
